<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Config - Disable SMBv3 Compression - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This Fixlet detects if SMBv3 is vulnerable to CVE-2020-0796</P>
<P>It takes into account the following items:</P>
<OL>
<LI>Vulnerable Windows OS Versions
<LI>SMBv3 Enablement
<LI>SMBv3 Compression Status</LI></OL>
<P>Actioning this Fixlet against a vulnerable device will disable SMBv3 Compression. </P>
<P>NOTE: This will only protect a SMBv3 Server and will not protect a SMBv3 Client. This remediation prevents the "Wormable" part of CVE-2020-0796.</P>
<P>This remediation is made available with no warranty expressed or otherwise and should be tested before being applied to any production or otherwise important systems.</P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists it whose (it = &quot;1903&quot; or it = &quot;1909&quot;) of preceding text of last &quot;)&quot; of following text of first &quot;(&quot; of (operating system as string)</Relevance>
    <Relevance>not exists values &quot;DisableCompression&quot; whose (it = 1) of keys &quot;HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\LanmanServer\Parameters&quot; of registry</Relevance>
    <Relevance>not exists values &quot;SMB2&quot; whose (it = 0) of keys &quot;HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\LanmanServer\Parameters&quot; of registry</Relevance>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2020-03-12</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Thu, 12 Mar 2020 17:38:54 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to deploy this action.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">regset &quot;[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\LanmanServer\Parameters]&quot; &quot;DisableCompression&quot;=dword:00000001</ActionScript>
    </DefaultAction>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
